logs-*.txt

# Claude Code context files (local only, not for repo)
CLAUDE.md
lessons.md
tasks/

# Temp/debug files
Upload location
check_table_exists.py
UPLOAD_INSTRUCTIONS.md

# Brand kit — source materials only. The runtime app reads from
# `assets/brand/` (curated subset), not these folders.
/Brand/
brand-kit/
# But DO track the curated brand assets we ship with the app
# (logos + favicon used by the dashboard at runtime). The
# leading `!` overrides the case-insensitive `Brand/` match
# that macOS APFS would otherwise apply to `assets/brand/`.
!assets/brand/
!assets/brand/**
